LiteRT 435efa884 (2026-11-10) "Revise Adreno Gen 8 FP32 GMU watchdog timeout
fix", verbatim (`git show --format= 435efa884`). patch_c_api.sh section 10b
adds it to the litert archive. The LiteRT pin bf49eb62 carries 12ec5f18d,
which changed the FP32 SDPA kernels for Adreno 8xx, 7xx and Mali; this commit
withdraws its Adreno 8xx part. With 95d3d567b (litert_adreno_flash_decode_keys)
it is what Gemma 4 at float32 on Adreno 8xx needs (0.20 migration D11). Drop it
once the LiteRT pin contains 435efa884.

